WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.037
So, the decisions together, and
none of them is a procurement.

2
00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:08.370
The CIO closes waves only after
the everyday tasks run cleanly,

3
00:00:08.370 --> 00:00:12.620
funds the operating layer, holds
the platform to its contract,

4
00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:17.287
gives every artifact an owner, and
staffs the desk from its measures.

5
00:00:17.287 --> 00:00:21.713
The CISO owns the verification ladder
and keeps automation read-only.

6
00:00:21.713 --> 00:00:24.731
The identity governance
officer reviews the desk's

7
00:00:24.731 --> 00:00:28.312
privileges and records a verdict
before any app is connected.

8
00:00:28.312 --> 00:00:33.987
System owners decide unknown assets and
close plan-of-action items only on re-test.

9
00:00:33.987 --> 00:00:36.487
The change board guards
the approval rules.

10
00:00:36.487 --> 00:00:39.076
The next step is free: run one reset,

11
00:00:39.076 --> 00:00:43.237
one joiner and one leaver,
and see what the record shows.

12
00:00:43.237 --> 00:00:45.587
Make the governed path the easy path.

13
00:00:45.587 --> 00:00:46.420
Thank you.
